        "created_at": "2015-09-27T13:33:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>(Woo, I can ask publically, since the PnP files were released!)</p><p>Some Fear cards can earn Fear themselves. For instance, the Dahan Raid fear effect at Terror Level 3 could cause quite a lot of damage to the invaders and earn a lot of fear. Suppose this earns another Fear card. Does it get resolved that same Fear phase or not?</p>",
